9. Controls

9.1 Desktop

* Mouse: aim special attacks.
* Left-click: activate the selected special attack.
* Space: activate the selected special attack.
* Number keys 1–4: quick-buy available upgrades.
* Escape: pause or resume.

Keyboard shortcuts should not trigger repeatedly while a purchase is still being processed.

9.2 Mobile

* Touch the special-attack button to activate the selected ability.
* Drag in the arena to aim when the selected ability supports aiming.
* Tap upgrade buttons to purchase upgrades.
* Tap the pause button to open the pause menu.

The initial stationary-core mode does not require a movement joystick. If a later mode introduces mobile movement, a virtual joystick can be added without changing the core upgrade system.

9.3 Accessibility

The interface should support:

* Adjustable sound and music volume.
* Reduced screen shake.
* Reduced visual effects.
* Clear text contrast.
* Large touch targets.
* Distinguishable cooldown states.
* A tutorial that explains the first match.

Important information must never be communicated through color alone.

