18. Quality Assurance

Before release, test the following:

* A core cannot have negative health.
* A destroyed core cannot continue attacking.
* Energy never becomes negative through a valid purchase.
* Upgrade prices increase correctly.
* Cooldowns cannot be bypassed by repeated button presses.
* Shields expire correctly.
* Projectiles are cleaned up.
* Simultaneous destruction produces the defined draw result.
* Restarting resets all match-specific state.
* Pausing freezes local gameplay.
* Returning from the background does not create a large unintended simulation jump.
* Touch controls work without accidental browser gestures.
* The AI follows the same resource rules as the player.
* Interface elements remain visible at narrow and wide aspect ratios.
* Performance remains acceptable during heavy combat.

