20. Definition of Done

LASER CLASH’s first milestone is complete when a player can:

1. Open the game.
2. Start a solo match.
3. Fight an AI opponent using automatic lasers.
4. Earn energy through gameplay.
5. Purchase upgrades that visibly affect combat.
6. Use special abilities strategically.
7. Win or lose through core destruction.
8. View match statistics.
9. Restart and play another match.
10. Complete the same loop in a web browser and on Android.

The game should be easy to understand within the first match, but have enough strategic depth to make players want to improve their upgrade choices and combat timing.

Final Vision

LASER CLASH should feel like a minimalist duel that escalates into spectacular geometric warfare. Its strength comes from the interaction between continuous automatic combat, tactical special attacks, energy management, and visible power progression.

Build the core battle first, prove that the gameplay is satisfying, and expand into multiplayer only after the fundamentals are reliable.

LASER CLASH — Charge. Upgrade. Overpower.